  "title": "Introducing the Pulse CLI",
  "summary": "The Pulse CLI brings Pulse's full document extraction pipeline to your terminal, letting you convert PDFs, folders, and URLs into clean Markdown and structured JSON with a single command. Built for developers, it integrates seamlessly with shell scripts, CI/CD, and automation workflows, making document processing fast, scriptable, and agent-ready. | Pulse AI",
